{{#with enquiry}}
<p class="greeting">Dear <strong>{{#if full_name}}{{full_name}}{{else}}Traveller{{/if}}</strong>,</p>

<p class="lead">
  Thank you again for your enquiry
  {{#if package_name}} about <strong>{{package_name}}</strong>{{else}} about travelling in Tanzania{{/if}}.
  Below is a personal response from our Arusha team — please read it carefully, and reply with any questions so we can refine the plan together.
</p>

<p class="section-label">Message from your safari consultant</p>
<div class="quote-box">{{{response_notes}}}</div>

<div class="info-box">
  <strong>Ready for the next step?</strong><br>
  Reply to this email with your preferred dates and group size, or WhatsApp us to talk through lodge options and pacing.
  When you are happy with the itinerary, we will send a clear written quote and deposit guidance — still with no surprise online charges for the enquiry itself.
</div>

<div class="cta-row">
  <a class="btn" href="https://wa.me/255695108009">Continue on WhatsApp</a>
  <a class="btn-secondary" href="{{#if site_url}}{{site_url}}{{else}}https://tanzaniasafarimagic.com{{/if}}/booking">Request a formal quote</a>
</div>

<p class="closing">We are excited to help shape your Tanzania journey — one thoughtful detail at a time.</p>
{{/with}}
